			["At 4 {npc:244808} sends you after a {npc:246143} who fled into the hills west of the church, just south of the bat cave. Talk to her to offer aid: she turns on you, and you have to put her down (level 3, easy)."] = "At 4 Aramis sends you after a Frightened Paladin who fled into the hills west of the church, just south of the bat cave. Talk to her to offer aid: she turns on you, and you have to put her down (level 3, easy).",
