			["{npc:246378} hands you {npc:259431}'s head for Sylvanas: keep it in your bags, it is what you hand in."] = "Danitha hands you Rudolph Gelhardt's head for Sylvanas: keep it in your bags, it is what you hand in.",
			["{npc:246378} offers the first Lesson in Divinity at level 12. Bring 10 {item:2589} if you have it: the {zone:1458} asks for it next."] = "Danitha offers the first Lesson in Divinity at level 12. Bring 10 Linen Cloth if you have it: the Undercity asks for it next.",
