			["Back to {npc:6251} in {area:392}. When you accept, he draws the summoning circle and his acolytes channel a greater circle over it: wait inside the tower until both are done. Then use the {quest:1804} on the circle. The felhunter (level 30, not elite) silences and eats mana, and it vanishes after two minutes: have your voidwalker out, open with your damage over time at once and let the voidwalker tank. If you die or it wins, abandon {quest:1795} and take it again from {npc:6251}. Keep the tome: {npc:6251} takes it back."] = "Back to Strahad in Ratchet. When you accept, he draws the summoning circle and his acolytes channel a greater circle over it: wait inside the tower until both are done. Then use the Tome of the Cabal on the circle. The felhunter (level 30, not elite) silences and eats mana, and it vanishes after two minutes: have your voidwalker out, open with your damage over time at once and let the voidwalker tank. If you die or it wins, abandon The Binding and take it again from Strahad. Keep the tome: Strahad takes it back.",
