			},
		},
		title = "{quest:1838}",
		version = 1,
		why = "Starts now at 20 at your trainer; four armor pieces at 30 (hauberk, helm, gauntlets, legguards), a shield on the way.",
		written = {
			["Back to {npc:5878} on {area:1699}. {quest:1848} is the first piece; he then sends you to three crafters, one per piece: take all three."] = "Back to Thun'grim on Thorn Hill. Brutal Hauberk is the first piece; he then sends you to three crafters, one per piece: take all three.",
			["Fly to {area:378}. {npc:6394} stands in the hut with the leatherworking and tailoring trainers."] = "Fly to Camp Taurajo. Ruga stands in the hut with the leatherworking and tailoring trainers.",
			["The Dragonmaw orcs (level 26-30) camp in the middle of the {zone:1437}; from {area:321} in Arathi head south over the {area:881} ({area:150} is Alliance). With {quest:1846} from {npc:6411} in your log, every Raider, Swamprunner, Centurion, Shadowwarder and Bonewarder drops a {item:7131} (without the quest they drop none): right-click it to test it, and about one in four comes out sturdy, the rest break, so expect 30 or more kills for 8. You can test while moving or fighting. The orcs run for help at 15%; Raiders net you, Centurions shield-bash, Shadowwarders cast {spell:686}, Bonewarders raise skeletons."] = "The Dragonmaw orcs (level 26-30) camp in the middle of the Wetlands; from Hammerfall in Arathi head south over the Thandol Span (Menethil Harbor is Alliance). With Dragonmaw Shinbones from Velora in your log, every Raider, Swamprunner, Centurion, Shadowwarder and Bonewarder drops a Dragonmaw Shinbone (without the quest they drop none): right-click it to test it, and about one in four comes out sturdy, the rest break, so expect 30 or more kills for 8. You can test while moving or fighting. The orcs run for help at 15%; Raiders net you, Centurions shield-bash, Shadowwarders cast Shadow Bolt, Bonewarders raise skeletons.",
			["{npc:5878}'s hut sits on top of {area:1699}, east of the Crossroads: climb the broad ridge on the north or east side. {quest:1838} is a level 30 quest, so the guide waits for level 29 before you take it. {item:7587} list where each material comes from."] = "Thun'grim's hut sits on top of Thorn Hill, east of the Crossroads: climb the broad ridge on the north or east side. Brutal Armor is a level 30 quest, so the guide waits for level 29 before you take it. Thun'grim's Instructions list where each material comes from.",
		},
		zone = 1413,
		zoneName = "The Barrens",
	}
end)

