			["The {object:58369} stands by a broken wagon in the Razormane camp north-west of {npc:5878}, north-east of the Crossroads. Two Razormanes guard it and their hunters pull more quilboar: clear them one at a time, then open the chest (it refills within seconds, so a friend can loot it too)."] = "The Stolen Iron Chest stands by a broken wagon in the Razormane camp north-west of Thun'grim, north-east of the Crossroads. Two Razormanes guard it and their hunters pull more quilboar: clear them one at a time, then open the chest (it refills within seconds, so a friend can loot it too).",
			["{npc:5878}'s hut sits on top of {area:1699}, east of the Crossroads. Most slopes are too steep: climb the broad ridge on the north or east side."] = "Thun'grim's hut sits on top of Thorn Hill, east of the Crossroads. Most slopes are too steep: climb the broad ridge on the north or east side.",
			["{npc:6390} sleeps in the mausoleum in the graveyard just north of Dillinger. To wake him, click the flat skull plaque on the ground, left of the path to the mausoleum door; the seal lifts and {npc:6390} (level 11, not elite) walks out. Start at full health."] = "Ulag sleeps in the mausoleum in the graveyard just north of Dillinger. To wake him, click the flat skull plaque on the ground, left of the path to the mausoleum door; the seal lifts and Ulag (level 11, not elite) walks out. Start at full health.",
		},
		zone = 1413,
		zoneName = "The Barrens",
	}
end)

