		},
		title = "{zone:1413}",
		version = 1,
		written = {
			["Back down to {npc:11857}."] = "Back down to Makaba.",
			["Back east over the bridge and up the trail to {npc:5900}'s shrine again. {npc:5900} makes {item:6636} from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the {npc:5893}, kill it for the {item:6655}, then place the ember in the brazier."] = "Back east over the bridge and up the trail to Telf's shrine again. Telf makes Fire Sapta from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the Minor Manifestation of Fire, kill it for the Glowing Ember, then place the ember in the brazier.",
			["Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; {npc:3438} walks among them. Careful: Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19) are elites in the camp's north-east, near {npc:3438} and the supply crates, and {npc:267307} (20, elite) lies in the cave under {area:1699} beside them: pull {npc:3438} and the quilboar away from them one at a time, and leave the cave alone unless you are in a group."] = "Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them. Careful: Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19) are elites in the camp's north-east, near Kreenig and the supply crates, and Chol'aruk (20, elite) lies in the cave under Thorn Hill beside them: pull Kreenig and the quilboar away from them one at a time, and leave the cave alone unless you are in a group.",
			["East along the road to {npc:4049} and {npc:11857}'s camp, on the way back out of Stonetalon."] = "East along the road to Seereth and Makaba's camp, on the way back out of Stonetalon.",
			["East from {npc:261366} toward the {area:382}: {npc:9316} stands at the camp on the road north of the Crossroads."] = "East from Walton toward the Sludge Fen: Wenikee stands at the camp on the road north of the Crossroads.",
			["Follow the road on west from {npc:4049} into Stonetalon. The troll village of {area:2539} sits at the entrance of the canyon."] = "Follow the road on west from Seereth into Stonetalon. The troll village of Malaka'jin sits at the entrance of the canyon.",
			["Follow the road south-east to {area:392} on the coast: {npc:3391} and {npc:7161} at the north end of town, {npc:3442} and {npc:16227}, {npc:3446} and the {object:3972} poster, then {quest:1492} on the dock on the way out south."] = "Follow the road south-east to Ratchet on the coast: Gazlowe and Wrenix at the north end of town, Sputtervalve and Bragok, Mebok and the WANTED poster, then Wharfmaster Dizzywig on the dock on the way out south.",
			["For your {area:718} run: {npc:3446}'s next errand, {quest:1491}."] = "For your Wailing Caverns run: Mebok's next errand, Smart Drinks.",
			["In from the north gate: {npc:3464} first, {npc:3338} by the inn, then up to {npc:3449} and {npc:3429} on the tower platform, where the flight master stands."] = "In from the north gate: Gazrog first, Sergra by the inn, then up to Darsok and Thork on the tower platform, where the flight master stands.",
			["Keep it: {npc:5875} in {zone:1454}, on the next guide's {zone:1454} stop"] = "Keep it: Gan'rul in Orgrimmar, on the next guide's Orgrimmar stop",
			["Keep {npc:3446}'s {quest:865} and {npc:3467} for the next {area:392} stop, at 18: Scytheclaws you meet on the plains before then drop the horns too."] = "Keep Mebok's Raptor Horns and Baron Longshore for the next Ratchet stop, at 18: Scytheclaws you meet on the plains before then drop the horns too.",
			["Leave {zone:1454} by the main gate and follow the road south through {zone:1411}, then west over the {area:814} bridge: {area:379} sits just above it on the {zone:1413} side. {npc:3337}, {quest:809} and {npc:5810} stand together."] = "Leave Orgrimmar by the main gate and follow the road south through Durotar, then west over the Southfury River bridge: Far Watch Post sits just above it on the Barrens side. Kargal Battlescar, Ak'Zeloth and Uzzek stand together.",
			["Lost Barrens Kodos roam the plains around the Kolkar camp north-west of {npc:3389}; herbalists pick {item:2449} there too."] = "Lost Barrens Kodos roam the plains around the Kolkar camp north-west of Regthar; herbalists pick Earthroot there too.",
			["Plainstriders roam the plains all over the {zone:1413}, and about one in four drops a beak: kill the ones you pass on the way."] = "Plainstriders roam the plains all over the Barrens, and about one in four drops a beak: kill the ones you pass on the way.",
			["Savannah Patriarchs roam the plains east of {npc:3682}'s camp, and the Sprung Traps lie among them."] = "Savannah Patriarchs roam the plains east of Vrang's camp, and the Sprung Traps lie among them.",
			["South down the road to the Crossroads: {npc:3449} stands on the tower platform, {npc:3448} at the south gate."] = "South down the road to the Crossroads: Darsok stands on the tower platform, Tonga Runetotem at the south gate.",
			["Speak to {npc:3389} again to start the attack: the Kolkar charge the bunkers just west of him in waves. Fight beside the grunts until {npc:9456} (elite, 20) arrives with two bodyguards, usually from the south, then click the banner over his body."] = "Speak to Regthar again to start the attack: the Kolkar charge the bunkers just west of him in waves. Fight beside the grunts until Warlord Krom'zar (elite, 20) arrives with two bodyguards, usually from the south, then click the banner over his body.",
			["Sunscale Scytheclaws hunt the plains around the {area:1697}; they drop the horns. {npc:3446} takes them back in {area:392}; any still missing come with {npc:3682}'s hills later.\
South-east toward the coast: the stolen silver lies in a raptor nest north-west of {area:385}."] = "Sunscale Scytheclaws hunt the plains around the Raptor Grounds; they drop the horns. Mebok takes them back in Ratchet; any still missing come with Vrang's hills later.\nSouth-east toward the coast: the stolen silver lies in a raptor nest north-west of Northwatch Hold.",
			["The Grimtotem camp is just north of {npc:11857}, a short walk off the road: Ruffians and Mercenaries stand among the tents."] = "The Grimtotem camp is just north of Makaba, a short walk off the road: Ruffians and Mercenaries stand among the tents.",
			["The next guide goes north-east across the {zone:1413} to the {area:1703} and {zone:1440}."] = "The next guide goes north-east across the Barrens to the Mor'shan Rampart and Ashenvale.",
			["The pools lie just north of {npc:3389}. Walk into the water to explore them; the Laden Mushrooms for Helbrim grow around them. Kill every Kolkar you pass for bracers. {npc:3394} stands in the Kolkar camp west of the pools."] = "The pools lie just north of Regthar. Walk into the water to explore them; the Laden Mushrooms for Helbrim grow around them. Kill every Kolkar you pass for bracers. Barak Kodobane stands in the Kolkar camp west of the pools.",
			["Warriors: take {quest:1824} from {npc:6394} now: it runs for 30 minutes from the accept. The antennae come first, at the Silithid Mounds south of the camp, then straight back to {npc:6394}; the thunderhawks after."] = "Warriors: take Trial at the Field of Giants from Ruga Ragetotem now: it runs for 30 minutes from the accept. The antennae come first, at the Silithid Mounds south of the camp, then straight back to Ruga; the thunderhawks after.",
			["West from the mine to {npc:9316}'s camp, then south down the road to the Crossroads."] = "West from the mine to Wenikee's camp, then south down the road to the Crossroads.",
			["West to the {area:383}. Any Witchwing harpy drops a talon: keep to the eastern slopes, where the Witchwing Harpies and Roguefeathers (14-15) nest; the Slayers and Windcallers (16-17) hold the western hills. Savannah Prowlers hunt the plains between {npc:3389} and the hills: take their claws on the way.\
Careful: There are 2 Witchwing Ambushers (level 17-18). They stay stealthed with Sneak while out of combat."] = "West to the Dry Hills. Any Witchwing harpy drops a talon: keep to the eastern slopes, where the Witchwing Harpies and Roguefeathers (14-15) nest; the Slayers and Windcallers (16-17) hold the western hills. Savannah Prowlers hunt the plains between Regthar and the hills: take their claws on the way.\nCareful: There are 2 Witchwing Ambushers (level 17-18). They stay stealthed with Sneak while out of combat.",
			["West to {npc:3389}'s watch post on the Kolkar border."] = "West to Regthar's watch post on the Kolkar border.",
			["You arrive from {area:379}. {npc:3489} and {npc:3338} stand by the inn, Helbrim and {npc:3464} by the north gate; {npc:3615}, {npc:3429} and {npc:3449} on the tower platform."] = "You arrive from Far Watch Post. Zargh and Sergra stand by the inn, Helbrim and Gazrog by the north gate; Devrak, Thork and Darsok on the tower platform.",
			["Your {area:718} quests, if you have not taken them yet: {npc:3446} beside the {object:3972} poster, {npc:3665} on the dock by the flight master. The run is later in this guide, after {npc:3396}."] = "Your Wailing Caverns quests, if you have not taken them yet: Mebok Mizzyrix beside the WANTED poster, Crane Operator Bigglefuzz on the dock by the flight master. The run is later in this guide, after Hezrul.",
			["{area:380} is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn: {npc:3338} by the inn, Helbrim and {npc:3464} by the north gate, then up the tower to {npc:3615}, the wind rider master, {npc:3429} and {npc:3449}, and {npc:3448} at the south gate on the way out."] = "The Crossroads is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn: Sergra by the inn, Helbrim and Gazrog by the north gate, then up the tower to Devrak, the wind rider master, Thork and Darsok, and Tonga at the south gate on the way out.",
			["{area:383}"] = "The Dry Hills",
			["{area:718} is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 17 to 24, and a full run takes about an hour. Its mouth is just north of {npc:3396}'s shore, at the north end of {area:387}, under {npc:5767}'s cave.\
In the caves before the portal: {npc:3655}, stealthed, with the {item:5334} (he moves between a few spots and comes back slowly: leave him if he's gone). Inside: the Deviates for {npc:5768}, and their hides for {npc:5767} (they drop rarely: one run may not be enough, so leave the rest for another run), {item:6464} from the Ectoplasms. After the four Fanglords, the {npc:3678} at the entrance leads you to Naralex: {npc:3654} drops the {item:10441}: its quest (someone in {area:392}, then {npc:8418} above the caverns) is not on this route; the Dungeons page's hand-in guide takes it."] = "Wailing Caverns is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 17 to 24, and a full run takes about an hour. Its mouth is just north of Hezrul's shore, at the north end of Lushwater Oasis, under Nalpak's cave.\nIn the caves before the portal: Mad Magglish, stealthed, with the 99-Year-Old Port (he moves between a few spots and comes back slowly: leave him if he's gone). Inside: the Deviates for Ebru, and their hides for Nalpak (they drop rarely: one run may not be enough, so leave the rest for another run), Wailing Essence from the Ectoplasms. After the four Fanglords, the Disciple of Naralex at the entrance leads you to Naralex: Mutanus the Devourer drops the Glowing Shard: its quest (someone in Ratchet, then Falla Sagewind above the caverns) is not on this route; the Dungeons page's hand-in guide takes it.",
			["{npc:11802}: the welcome from {npc:3033}"] = "Dendrite Starblaze: the welcome from Turak",
			["{npc:11856}, inside {npc:11858}'s hut"] = "Kaya Flathoof, inside Grundig's hut",
			["{npc:11857}: keep it, {npc:11864} at {area:460} in the {zone:1413} & Stonetalon guide"] = "Makaba Flathoof: keep it, Tammra Windfield at Sun Rock Retreat in the Barrens & Stonetalon guide",
			["{npc:261366}, the hermit on the ridge behind {npc:3682}: on the next {area:383} visit, with {npc:3452}"] = "Walton, the hermit on the ridge behind Vrang: on the next Dry Hills visit, with Serena",
			["{npc:261366}, the hermit, stands on the ridge behind {npc:3682}'s camp."] = "Walton, the hermit, stands on the ridge behind Vrang's camp.",
			["{npc:3338} by the inn first, then Helbrim by the north gate, {npc:3429} and {npc:3449} on the tower platform, {npc:3432} by the inn, and {npc:3448} at the south gate last. His seed test waits for the {npc:3395} pass at the {area:388}: go straight on north-west to the {area:383}. After the spores Helbrim offers {quest:853}, a delivery to {zone:1456} within 45 minutes: this route doesn't go there, so leave it (Druids take it on the next Crossroads stop, right before their flight to {zone:1456})."] = "Sergra by the inn first, then Helbrim by the north gate, Thork and Darsok on the tower platform, Mankrik by the inn, and Tonga at the south gate last. His seed test waits for the Verog pass at the Stagnant Oasis: go straight on north-west to the Dry Hills. After the spores Helbrim offers Apothecary Zamah, a delivery to Thunder Bluff within 45 minutes: this route doesn't go there, so leave it (Druids take it on the next Crossroads stop, right before their flight to Thunder Bluff).",
			["{npc:3389}: {npc:3395} comes out when you kill the Kolkar at the {area:388}, later"] = "Regthar Deathgate: Verog comes out when you kill the Kolkar at the Stagnant Oasis, later",
			["{npc:3395} doesn't wander on his own: he comes out when you kill the Kolkar centaurs at the {area:388}, south-east of the Crossroads. Keep killing them around the oasis until he appears. Test {npc:3448}'s seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank while you are there."] = "Verog doesn't wander on his own: he comes out when you kill the Kolkar centaurs at the Stagnant Oasis, south-east of the Crossroads. Keep killing them around the oasis until he appears. Test Tonga's seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank while you are there.",
			["{npc:3396} leads the Kolkar on the west shore of {area:387}, south of {npc:3389}. He walks that shore, from about 46,36 in the north to 46,42 in the south: if he isn't at the arrow, follow the shore until you meet him. Hand his head to {npc:3389} on your last Crossroads stop. Oasis Snapjaws crawl in the oasis' water there: their shells are for {npc:3448}."] = "Hezrul leads the Kolkar on the west shore of Lushwater Oasis, south of Regthar. He walks that shore, from about 46,36 in the north to 46,42 in the south: if he isn't at the arrow, follow the shore until you meet him. Hand his head to Regthar on your last Crossroads stop. Oasis Snapjaws crawl in the oasis' water there: their shells are for Tonga.",
			["{npc:3428}'s {quest:868} waits for this guide's last Crossroads stop: its eggs come on the next {zone:1413} guide's walk south, at about 25."] = "Korran's Egg Hunt waits for this guide's last Crossroads stop: its eggs come on the next Barrens guide's walk south, at about 25.",
			["{npc:3428}, west of the north gate: keep {quest:868}, its eggs lie on the next {zone:1413} guide's walk south from {area:378}, at about 25"] = "Korran, west of the north gate: keep Egg Hunt, its eggs lie on the next Barrens guide's walk south from Camp Taurajo, at about 25",
			["{npc:3442}: {npc:9316} stands on the road north of the Crossroads, on the way to the {area:382}"] = "Sputtervalve: Wenikee stands on the road north of the Crossroads, on the way to the Sludge Fen",
			["{npc:3448}: the Oasis Snapjaws at {area:387}, with {npc:3396} after the {zone:1454} trip"] = "Tonga Runetotem: the Oasis Snapjaws at Lushwater Oasis, with Hezrul after the Orgrimmar trip",
			["{npc:3448}: the bubbling fissure at the {area:388}, on the {npc:3395} pass"] = "Tonga Runetotem: the bubbling fissure at the Stagnant Oasis, on the Verog pass",
