Careful: Silithid Swarmers in the area release many tiny adds that interrupt spells; damage shields such as Thorns kill them in one hit."] = "South of Camp Taurajo, on the road to Gann, the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them.\nCareful: Silithid Swarmers in the area release many tiny adds that interrupt spells; damage shields such as Thorns kill them in one hit.",
			["South-west of Sun Rock lies the burned {area:465}. Plant the Gaea Seeds in the dirt mounds on the valley floor; the fire elementals drop {item:16312}. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south. Careful: the Burning Destroyers, Scorched Basilisks and Bloodfury Storm Witches here are level 27 and the valley floor is crowded: pull one at a time and keep to its edges."] = "South-west of Sun Rock lies the burned Charred Vale. Plant the Gaea Seeds in the dirt mounds on the valley floor; the fire elementals drop Incendrites. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south. Careful: the Burning Destroyers, Scorched Basilisks and Bloodfury Storm Witches here are level 27 and the valley floor is crowded: pull one at a time and keep to its edges.",
