Inside: Rethilgore first; the Deathstalker freed from the cells after him opens the courtyard door, and {npc:4444} lies just inside the courtyard, to the right: hand {quest:1098} in to him there. Then {npc:3886}, {npc:3887}, {npc:4278}, {npc:4279}, {npc:4274} and {npc:3927}; {npc:4275} at the top drops his head for {npc:1938}."] = "Shadowfang Keep is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 20 to 30, and a full run takes about an hour. Follow the road south from the Sepulcher: the keep stands on the hill above Pyrewood Village, its gate at the top of the path.\nInside: Rethilgore first; the Deathstalker freed from the cells after him opens the courtyard door, and Deathstalker Vincent lies just inside the courtyard, to the right: hand Deathstalkers in Shadowfang in to him there. Then Razorclaw the Butcher, Baron Silverlaine, Commander Springvale, Odo the Blindwatcher, Fenrus the Devourer and Wolf Master Nandos; Archmage Arugal at the top drops his head for Dalar.",
