					},
				},
				note = "The next guide opens with Korran's The Swarm Grows at the Crossroads, offered from level 29. Short of 29? The Pesterhide Snarlers (28-29) prowl the canyon floor just north-west of {area:484}: kill them until level 29. Or, with a group, run the {area:2797} dungeon instead.",
