		title = "{zone:1440} & {zone:1441}",
		version = 1,
		written = {
			["A short walk north of the Galak camps, the cave of {area:1557} leads down to its deepest chamber, where the {object:20807} burns. Use the {item:5868} on it, then loot the {item:5869} at once: the flame only stays out briefly, and if it relights the phial is gone. Then east to {npc:2986}'s mesa.\
Careful: Two Galak Flame Guards (30) stand by the brazier and a centaur guard walks the cave: pull them away one at a time before you douse the flame."] = "A short walk north of the Galak camps, the cave of Splithoof Hold leads down to its deepest chamber, where the Ancient Brazier burns. Use the Filled Etched Phial on it, then loot the Cloven Hoof at once: the flame only stays out briefly, and if it relights the phial is gone. Then east to Dorn's mesa.\nCareful: Two Galak Flame Guards (30) stand by the brazier and a centaur guard walks the cave: pull them away one at a time before you douse the flame.",
			["Back south-west to {area:421}. {npc:12759}, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the {item:16408} only once you have {quest:25} from {npc:12737}; it starts a quest for Splintertree."] = "Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the Befouled Water Globe only once you have Stonetalon Standstill from Mastok; it starts a quest for Splintertree.",
			["For your {area:2797} run, in the same tunnels as the Sapphires: {npc:12736}'s ruins errand. Look for a group now if you have none yet."] = "For your Blackfathom Deeps run, in the same tunnels as the Sapphires: Je'neu's ruins errand. Look for a group now if you have none yet.",
			["Keep {npc:4877}'s two harpy quests and {npc:2986}'s {quest:1150}: {area:487} comes with the next Freewind visit, at about 30, with the {area:2240}'s quests."] = "Keep Jandia's two harpy quests and Dorn's Test of Endurance: Roguefeather Den comes with the next Freewind visit, at about 30, with the Mirage Raceway's quests.",
			["Kill the {npc:10720} that comes for {npc:10638}"] = "Kill the Galak Assassin that comes for Kanati",
			["Short of 28? The Grimtotem around these camps (25-28) are the right level: kill a few more before the climb to {npc:10646}. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the {area:2797} dungeon instead."] = "Short of 28? The Grimtotem around these camps (25-28) are the right level: kill a few more before the climb to Lakota. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead.",
			["The Laughing Sisters, dryads, wander {area:426} around {npc:12677}'s woods; one of them drops {npc:4721}'s {item:5867}, which can take several kills."] = "The Laughing Sisters, dryads, wander Raynewood Retreat around Shadumbra's woods; one of them drops Zangen's Etched Phial, which can take several kills.",
			["The Wanted poster beside {npc:10537}"] = "The Wanted poster beside Cliffwatcher",
			["{area:2797} is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 22 to 30, and a full run takes about an hour. Its portal is a little further along the tunnels you are in, past the Sapphires.\
Inside: the {object:177964} lies under the water of the Moonshrine Ruins' pool, beneath the walkway (clear the crabs first): open it for the {item:16762}, and {quest:6922} comes; open the {item:16782} he drops for a quest for {npc:12736}. The Tide Priestesses sometimes drop a {item:16790}: open it for another quest for {npc:12736}. {npc:4787}, by a campfire in an underwater side room off Ghamoo-ra's room, offers Blackfathom Villainy ({npc:4832}' head, for {npc:9087} on {zone:1456}'s {area:1639})."] = "Blackfathom Deeps is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 22 to 30, and a full run takes about an hour. Its portal is a little further along the tunnels you are in, past the Sapphires.\nInside: the Fathom Stone lies under the water of the Moonshrine Ruins' pool, beneath the walkway (clear the crabs first): open it for the Fathom Core, and Baron Aquanis comes; open the Strange Water Globe he drops for a quest for Je'neu. The Tide Priestesses sometimes drop a Damp Note: open it for another quest for Je'neu. Argent Guard Thaelrid, by a campfire in an underwater side room off Ghamoo-ra's room, offers Blackfathom Villainy (Twilight Lord Kelris' head, for Bashana Runetotem on Thunder Bluff's Elder Rise).",
			["{area:485}"] = "The Great Lift",
			["{area:485} detour warning: the arrow may miss the path up {area:2097}. If you are on the canyon floor, follow the path and rope bridges up {area:2097}. {npc:10646} is held captive beside {npc:10896} (29): clear the guards and {npc:10896} first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way."] = "Great Lift detour warning: the arrow may miss the path up Darkcloud Pinnacle. If you are on the canyon floor, follow the path and rope bridges up Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way.",
			["{npc:10428}'s next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in {zone:1456}, off this route. Skip it."] = "Motega's next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in Thunder Bluff, off this route. Skip it.",
			["{npc:12576} and {npc:10079} wait at the top of the {area:485}: Maggran's letter is for {npc:12576}, and Moonhorn's message goes down to {area:484} with you."] = "Grish Longrunner and Brave Moonhorn wait at the top of the Great Lift: Maggran's letter is for Grish, and Moonhorn's message goes down to Freewind Post with you.",
			["{npc:12736} offers a {area:2797} quest next; leave it unless you have a group."] = "Je'neu offers a Blackfathom Deeps quest next; leave it unless you have a group.",
			["{npc:12736} then offers the next part, {quest:6564}: it is for a second run, so leave it."] = "Je'neu then offers the next part, Allegiance to the Old Gods: it is for a second run, so leave it.",
			["{npc:3024} stands beside {npc:4721}, east of {npc:2995}."] = "Tah Winterhoof stands beside Zangen, east of Tal.",
			["{npc:4722} stands in {area:484}: {npc:4721}'s filled phial is for him."] = "Rau Cliffrunner stands in Freewind Post: Zangen's filled phial is for him.",
		},
		zone = 1440,
		zoneName = "Ashenvale",
	}
end)

