			["West of Freewind Post, below {area:2097}, the harpies of {area:487} (28-30). The Screeching Harpies, Roguefeathers and Windcallers there are {npc:4877}'s; her {quest:98069} lie on the ground along the foot of the cliff and in the cave up on top. {npc:4490} (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her, for {npc:2986}'s claw."] = "West of Freewind Post, below Darkcloud Pinnacle, the harpies of Roguefeather Den (28-30). The Screeching Harpies, Roguefeathers and Windcallers there are Jandia's; her Stolen Freewind Supplies lie on the ground along the foot of the cliff and in the cave up on top. Grenka Bloodscreech (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her, for Dorn's claw.",
			["the tamed kodo, at {npc:11596}'s camp: talk to it, five times"] = "the tamed kodo, at Smeed's camp: talk to it, five times",
			["{npc:11863}'s next errand, the {item:15803}, needs {npc:12369} (38) out on {area:2406}: leave it, he is over your level."] = "Azore's next errand, the Book of the Ancients, needs Lord Kragaru (38) out on Ranazjar Isle: leave it, he is over your level.",
			["{npc:4452}'s crate for {quest:5762} in Stranglethorn, later on the route"] = "Kravel's crate for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, later on the route",
			["{npc:5395} now offers Centaur Bounty: the second {zone:1443} visit, at 38, takes it on its way to the {area:607}."] = "Felgur now offers Centaur Bounty: the second Desolace visit, at 38, takes it on its way to the Valley of Spears.",
			["{npc:5395} stands in the post, {npc:11259} up on its rise; {npc:5641} and {npc:4498} wait on the rise west of it, above the {area:596}."] = "Felgur stands in the post, Nataka Longhorn up on its rise; Takata Steelblade and Maurin Bonesplitter wait on the rise west of it, above the Kodo Graveyard.",
			["{npc:5641} and {npc:4498}"] = "Takata and Maurin",
			["{npc:5641}'s next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it."] = "Takata's next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it.",
			["{npc:5905} also starts Elemental Aid ({area:1717}), the 33-40 chain to The Tempest's Weapons: forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde."] = "Prate also starts Elemental Aid (Razorfen Kraul), the 33-40 chain to The Tempest's Weapons: forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde.",
			["{object:177787} lies on the ground just south-west of {npc:11863}'s tower, on the way down to the shore: read it. Its two keys drop only while you have the quest."] = "Rackmore's Log lies on the ground just south-west of Azore's tower, on the way down to the shore: read it. Its two keys drop only while you have the quest.",
		},
