			["Follow the road north out of {object:3202}; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. {npc:773} wants it investigated: walk among its tents. From here on, keep every page of The {item:2755} you loot: {npc:716} takes them on your next Stranglethorn visit."] = "Follow the road north out of Grom'gol; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. Krazek wants it investigated: walk among its tents. From here on, keep every page of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn you loot: Barnil takes them on your next Stranglethorn visit.",
