Careful: Bloodscalp Berserkers and Headhunters (36-37) and Witch Doctors (37, casters) hold the ruins north and west of {npc:268992}, close to the northern shipments (around 24.9,9.6): pick the shipments in the southern ruins by {npc:268992} first, and pull one at a time if you go north."] = "Zimmix Sputterspark is held at the east edge of the Ruins of Zul'Kunda; the Stolen Shipments lie among the ruins around him. The Bloodscalp Scouts, Hunters and Mystics (34-35) there carry his Primitive Key. Then lead him out of the ruins: Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay takes the news and the shipments.\nCareful: Bloodscalp Berserkers and Headhunters (36-37) and Witch Doctors (37, casters) hold the ruins north and west of Zimmix, close to the northern shipments (around 24.9,9.6): pick the shipments in the southern ruins by Zimmix first, and pull one at a time if you go north.",
