			["Head east to {area:602}. With the {quest:5381} from {npc:11624} in your bags, open a demon portal's ring: a {npc:11937} (38-39) comes out; kill it to close that portal. Six portals. Careful: Infernals, Doomguards and Burning Blade Summoners walk close by many portals and may join in; kill nearby mobs first or drag the guardian away, for example toward the coven's central lake."] = "Head east to Mannoroc Coven. With the Hand of Iruxos from Taiga in your bags, open a demon portal's ring: a Demon Portal Guardian (38-39) comes out; kill it to close that portal. Six portals. Careful: Infernals, Doomguards and Burning Blade Summoners walk close by many portals and may join in; kill nearby mobs first or drag the guardian away, for example toward the coven's central lake.",
			["South down the coast to Shadowprey: {npc:11624} takes the box and sends you to {area:602} with it; {npc:12340} takes the naga."] = "South down the coast to Shadowprey: Taiga takes the box and sends you to Mannoroc Coven with it; Drulzegar takes the naga.",
			["West of the post, the Maraudine centaurs hold the {area:607}; every Maraudine can drop a {item:254432} and an ear for {npc:5395}'s {quest:1366}. Stay with the Scouts and Wranglers (36-38) at the valley's eastern edge; the Maulers and Windchasers (38-39) a little further in are up to two over you at 37: pull them one at a time.\
Careful: {npc:5402} and the Rock Worms (41-42, elite) hold the valley's north-western end with the Khan Guards and Marauders (39-40), and the Magram's village in the south-east has Necromancers (42-43): keep east of the arrow."] = "West of the post, the Maraudine centaurs hold the Valley of Spears; every Maraudine can drop a Carved Centaur Totem and an ear for Felgur's Centaur Bounty. Stay with the Scouts and Wranglers (36-38) at the valley's eastern edge; the Maulers and Windchasers (38-39) a little further in are up to two over you at 37: pull them one at a time.\nCareful: Khan Hratha and the Rock Worms (41-42, elite) hold the valley's north-western end with the Khan Guards and Marauders (39-40), and the Magram's village in the south-east has Necromancers (42-43): keep east of the arrow.",
			["{npc:12277} is held in the Maraudine camp at the valley's western end; free her and escort her out east of the valley.\
Careful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help."] = "Melizza is held in the Maraudine camp at the valley's western end; free her and escort her out east of the valley.\nCareful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help.",
			["{npc:3412}'s workshop is in the {object:172958} beside {npc:4485}: hand in {quest:2841} if you ran {area:133}."] = "Nogg's workshop is in the Valley of Honor beside Belgrom: hand in Rig Wars if you ran Gnomeregan.",
			["{npc:6019} waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the {area:596}."] = "Hornizz waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard.",
			["{object:20985}, now that {npc:4791} has read the report"] = "Loose Dirt, now that Nazeer has read the report",
		},
		zone = 1445,
		zoneName = "Dustwallow Marsh",
	}
end)

