		title = "{zone:1444} & {zone:1446}",
		version = 1,
		written = {
			["On south-west to the jungle north-east of Mistvale: the three ghostly pirates haunt it beside Zanzil's camps. {npc:2535} and {npc:2536} stand together, {npc:2537} further east. Every one of Zanzil's followers can carry the mixture.\
Careful: the Zanzil Witch Doctors (44) cast and the camps are packed: pull from the edge, one at a time. {npc:2534} (46) himself stands in the southern camp around 39.6,58.6, a few steps from {npc:2537}'s ghost: pull {npc:2537} out to the north or east before you fight him."] = "On south-west to the jungle north-east of Mistvale: the three ghostly pirates haunt it beside Zanzil's camps. Maury and Jon-Jon stand together, Chucky further east. Every one of Zanzil's followers can carry the mixture.\nCareful: the Zanzil Witch Doctors (44) cast and the camps are packed: pull from the edge, one at a time. Zanzil the Outcast (46) himself stands in the southern camp around 39.6,58.6, a few steps from Chucky's ghost: pull Chucky out to the north or east before you fight him.",
			["South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. {npc:7883} and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often.\
Careful: Two or three pirates stand with {npc:7883} (45), and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts: pull his guards away from him first."] = "South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. Andre Firebeard and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often.\nCareful: Two or three pirates stand with Andre (45), and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts: pull his guards away from him first.",
			["South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the {area:43}; the charts and the orders lie in their tents and in the rowboat beside the larger camp. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and {npc:2493}'s eye, so keep killing until you have both."] = "South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the Wild Shore; the charts and the orders lie in their tents and in the rowboat beside the larger camp. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and Dizzy's eye, so keep killing until you have both.",
			["The flight lands at {object:3202}. Stranglethorn's harder errands, carried from your first visit, fit you now: the Skullsplitter chief, Zanzil's camps, {area:35}'s pirates, the naga coast and {npc:1514}, before the zeppelin to {zone:1454}. The {object:2076} beside Nimboya has the Skullsplitter chief's quest."] = "The flight lands at Grom'gol. Stranglethorn's harder errands, carried from your first visit, fit you now: the Skullsplitter chief, Zanzil's camps, Booty Bay's pirates, the naga coast and Mokk, before the zeppelin to Orgrimmar. The Bubbling Cauldron beside Nimboya has the Skullsplitter chief's quest.",
			["The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of {area:976}.\
South-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; {npc:7847} stands in the eastern camp.\
Careful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.\
Careful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them."] = "The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan.\nSouth-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; Caliph stands in the eastern camp.\nCareful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.\nCareful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them.",
			["West into Mistvale: {npc:1449} sits among the gorillas. Any gorilla can drop a fang: hand him ten and stay by him, he calls three waves of gorillas, then {npc:1514}.\
Careful: three waves of gorillas come one after another with little rest between, then {npc:1514}. Start at full health and mana, and stay near Unbagwa. Some classes find it hard alone: a friend makes it easy."] = "West into Mistvale: Witch Doctor Unbagwa sits among the gorillas. Any gorilla can drop a fang: hand him ten and stay by him, he calls three waves of gorillas, then Mokk.\nCareful: three waves of gorillas come one after another with little rest between, then Mokk the Savage. Start at full health and mana, and stay near Unbagwa. Some classes find it hard alone: a friend makes it easy.",
			["{zone:2652} is next, a ride north from {area:1099} into {zone:1443}: keep your {zone:1454} hand-ins (Neeru, Zilzibin, {npc:4485}, {npc:7311}) for the flight there after it."] = "Shen'dralas is next, a ride north from Camp Mojache into Desolace: keep your Orgrimmar hand-ins (Neeru, Zilzibin, Belgrom, Uthel'nay) for the flight there after it.",
		},
		zone = 1444,
		zoneName = "Feralas",
	}
end)

