			["West along the road south; {npc:7771} camps by the ruins at the {area:1938}. Put on his {item:9978}: it shows the buried ornaments, here and around the {area:983}."] = "West along the road south; Marvon camps by the ruins at the Broken Pillar. Put on his Gahz'ridian Detector: it shows the buried ornaments, here and around the Dunemaul Compound.",
