						npcName = "Deadwood Avenger",
						t = "level",
						x = 61.1,
						y = 9.04,
						z = 550.8,
					},
				},
				note = "{zone:1452}'s quests are 55-58. Below 55 after {npc:9996}'s hand-ins? {area:1762}'s Deadwood furbolgs (53-55) are at your level and on your way north to {area:1769}'s tunnel: kill them until level 55. Every kill also raises your Timbermaw reputation. Careful: the Den Watchers and Avengers call nearby allies once below half health and run off for help when nearly dead: pull one at a time from the village's edge. This is a long top-up for a player who follows only this route. Or, with a group, run the {area:1584} dungeon or the {area:1417} dungeon instead.",
				title = "Level 55",
				when = {
					{
						k = "level",
						n = 55,
						op = "<",
					},
				},
			},
		},
		title = "{zone:1448} & {zone:1422}",
		version = 1,
		written = {
			["Follow the road north-east to {area:1767}. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a {item:11503}; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo, and their organs are {npc:10920}'s.\
{area:1762}'s Deadwood Den Watchers (53-54) and Avengers (54-55) are next: below level 54, keep hunting the grizzlies and ravagers (51-52) here until 54. The hand-ins at {area:1769}, the {area:2479} and {area:1997} that follow take you most of the way to 55. Or, with a group, run the {area:1417} dungeon or the {area:1584} dungeon instead."] = "Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo, and their organs are Kelek's.\nFelpaw Village's Deadwood Den Watchers (53-54) and Avengers (54-55) are next: below level 54, keep hunting the grizzlies and ravagers (51-52) here until 54. The hand-ins at Timbermaw Hold, the Emerald Sanctuary and Bloodvenom Post that follow take you most of the way to 55. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon or the Blackrock Depths dungeon instead.",
			["From the {area:152}, follow the road east into the {zone:1422}. The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand just past Felstone Farm, between {area:199} and {area:200}. Torch the command tent with the {object:176092} and plant the Scourge banner. Careful: the Scarlets around the tents reach 54 and the Invokers cast: come in from the side nearest the command tent and leave the others be."] = "From the Bulwark, follow the road east into the Western Plaguelands. The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand just past Felstone Farm, between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner. Careful: the Scarlets around the tents reach 54 and the Invokers cast: come in from the side nearest the command tent and leave the others be.",
			["Ride back south past {area:1763} to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill {npc:9996}'s flasket there."] = "Ride back south past Jaedenar to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill Winna's flasket there.",
			["Ride south-west past Felstone Farm and follow the road west back to the {area:152}."] = "Ride south-west past Felstone Farm and follow the road west back to the Bulwark.",
			["Take the kitten to the same moonwell and release it there with {item:12565}; once it has turned into a {npc:10042}, bring it back to {npc:9996} and click on it to hand it over."] = "Take the kitten to the same moonwell and release it there with Winna's Kitten Carrier; once it has turned into a Corrupted Saber, bring it back to Winna and click on it to hand it over.",
			["{npc:10920}, beside {npc:10921}: {quest:86577}, the organs of {zone:1448}'s bears and wolves"] = "Kelek Skykeeper, beside Taronn: A Sampling of Putrescence, the organs of Felwood's bears and wolves",
			["{npc:9996}'s kitten"] = "Winna's kitten",
			["{zone:1452}'s quests are 55-58. Below 55 after {npc:9996}'s hand-ins? {area:1762}'s Deadwood furbolgs (53-55) are at your level and on your way north to {area:1769}'s tunnel: kill them until level 55. Every kill also raises your Timbermaw reputation. Careful: the Den Watchers and Avengers call nearby allies once below half health and run off for help when nearly dead: pull one at a time from the village's edge. This is a long top-up for a player who follows only this route. Or, with a group, run the {area:1584} dungeon or the {area:1417} dungeon instead."] = "Winterspring's quests are 55-58. Below 55 after Winna's hand-ins? Felpaw Village's Deadwood furbolgs (53-55) are at your level and on your way north to Timbermaw Hold's tunnel: kill them until level 55. Every kill also raises your Timbermaw reputation. Careful: the Den Watchers and Avengers call nearby allies once below half health and run off for help when nearly dead: pull one at a time from the village's edge. This is a long top-up for a player who follows only this route. Or, with a group, run the Blackrock Depths dungeon or the Sunken Temple dungeon instead.",
		},
		zone = 1448,
		zoneName = "Felwood",
	}
end)

