			["Keep the deliveries for {npc:8659}, {npc:6522}, {npc:4485} and {npc:3326}: you pass {zone:1454} and the {zone:1458} next. Magatha's, in {zone:1456}, is off this route: leave it."] = "Keep the deliveries for Jes'rimon, Andron Gant, Belgrom and Zevrost: you pass Orgrimmar and the Undercity next. Magatha's, in Thunder Bluff, is off this route: leave it.",
