Careful: a {npc:250023}, a level 55-57 elite, stands at the west edge of the camp: work the blood elves from its east side."] = "The blood elves camp on the cliffs in the north-east, by the Bay of Storms. Kim'jael's four pieces of equipment lie in the crates around the camp; the Blood Elf Arcanists carry Izvi's wand.\nCareful: a Blackmaw Thrall, a level 55-57 elite, stands at the west edge of the camp: work the blood elves from its east side.",
			["{npc:10778}'s farm is the first one east of the {area:152}. Jabbering Ghouls on the farm carry the other half of her charm; {npc:11075} guards the cauldron in the field.\
Careful: One or two undead usually fight alongside him, and more cauldron lords can attack after you use the cauldron."] = "Janice Felstone's farm is the first one east of the Bulwark. Jabbering Ghouls on the farm carry the other half of her charm; Cauldron Lord Bilemaw guards the cauldron in the field.\nCareful: One or two undead usually fight alongside him, and more cauldron lords can attack after you use the cauldron.",
