			["Knights and magi work the {area:192}; the medics and hunters camp south of it. Set {npc:11615}'s termite barrel down in the middle of the lumber mill while you are there.\
Careful: a {npc:10996}, a level 58-59 elite, can stand at the lumber camp, as at many other spots of the {zone:1422}: give it room."] = "Knights and magi work the Northridge Lumber Camp; the medics and hunters camp south of it. Set Mickey's termite barrel down in the middle of the lumber mill while you are there.\nCareful: a Fallen Hero, a level 58-59 elite, can stand at the lumber camp, as at many other spots of the Western Plaguelands: give it room.",
