				},
				note = "{npc:5875} stands in the {object:172960}, the canyon under the {object:172982}. Hand him the {item:6535}, then use the {item:7464} on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the voidwalker to bind it.\nCareful: the voidwalker you summon hits hard and it is the fight Warlocks die to most in {zone:1454}: start at full health and mana, send your imp in, keep Corruption and Immolate on it, and use a healthstone if you have one.",
