		written = {
			["Fly to {area:1237} in western {zone:1447}: on Forever, {quest:3505} starts with {npc:8576} there, with no letter from {npc:4485} first. The {quest:3505} quests are level 53 and pay in full at 60 too, as every quest does in Forever. {npc:8576} sends you north-east to the blood elf camp on the bluffs of the northern peninsula."] = "Fly to Valormok in western Azshara: on Forever, Betrayed starts with Ag'tor Bloodfist there, with no letter from Belgrom Rockmaul first. The Betrayed quests are level 53 and pay in full at 60 too, as every quest does in Forever. Ag'tor sends you north-east to the blood elf camp on the bluffs of the northern peninsula.",
