			["Prowlers, {npc:3452} and {quest:881}"] = "Prowlers, Serena and Echeyakee",
			["Savannah Prowlers lie west and north of the Crossroads. {quest:876} leads the Witchwing harpies in the far north-west. Then {npc:3338} gives you the {item:10327}: blow it beside the kodo bones at {object:147524}, north of the town, and kill the white lion."] = "Savannah Prowlers lie west and north of the Crossroads. Serena Bloodfeather leads the Witchwing harpies in the far north-west. Then Sergra gives you the Horn of Echeyakee: blow it beside the kodo bones at Echeyakee's Lair, north of the town, and kill the white lion.",
